            "title": "Question 7",
            "id": 62390,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale operatore memorizza il risultato di un confronto in una variabile?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\" iscode=\"false\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\"><code>=</code></item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\"><code>===</code></item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\"><code>&lt;=</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sostituisci <code>=</code> con <code>===</code> in <code>const canEnter = age &gt;= 18;</code>. Che cosa accade?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">La dichiarazione non è valida perché <code>===</code> confronta invece di assegnare.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>canEnter</code> memorizza ancora se <code>age</code> è almeno 18.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>canEnter</code> memorizza invece il valore di <code>age</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">La dichiarazione non è valida perché <code>===</code> confronta invece di assegnare.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 8",
            "id": 62391,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale operatore ci serve per verificare se un numero a sinistra dell'istruzione è minore o uguale a <code>21</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&lt;=</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>&gt;=</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>L'ingresso è consentito quando <code>age</code> è minore o uguale a <code>21</code>. Quale operatore completa <code>age ... 21</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&lt;=</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>&gt;=</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>===</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 3",
            "id": 62387,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Memorizza il risultato del confronto in <code>pass</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"32\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" minScore = \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pass = score &gt;= minScore;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(pass);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>const</code>, seguito da <code>pass</code> e poi <code>=</code>, <code>score &gt;= minScore</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Memorizza il risultato del confronto in <code>pass</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"32\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" minScore = \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pass = score &gt;= minScore;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(pass);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"typeof\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>const</code>, seguito da <code>pass</code>, <code>=</code> e infine <code>score &gt;= minScore</code>.</p></body></html>"
