            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usa un operatore di confronto per confrontare <code>score</code> con <code>expected</code> in modo da visualizzare <code>false</code> nella console.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"&quot;high&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" expected = \" /><text value=\"&quot;low&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(score === expected);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>",
